  "scope": "The literal 544-slot controller reads the original represented rational row, computes its actual width and binary length through the exact child machines, and hands the same returned words directly to the real grid-fuel constructor. Two actual allocations return the dimension/width/fuel record. Exact old dimension, inputWidth and gridFuel fields are proved, with a terminal-inclusive physical bound using only original padded field bits, row length and initial physical H/B. Twelve literal physical cases retain all original input and source. The original row representation is supplied; lambda/guess generation and whole solver composition remain separate.",
